</entry><entry thead="no"><para>4 轮 × 16 步 = 64 步  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>初始向量 (IV)  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>RFC 1321 §3.3 定义  </para>
</entry></row>
